==Documentation==
Use this template in the Catfruit Evolution section, whenever a Cat Unit needs Catfruit to evolve into its True Form or Ultra Form. If used in the main namespace, [[:Category:Cats by evolution material|categories]] for the passed Catfruit types will be added automatically.

==Usage==
You have 5 fields for the first row to edit, 6 fields for the second row. There are also parameters for the names, images, and evolution description. If the unit also has an Ultra Form evolution, there are additional parameters.

===First Row===
The first row displays the pictures. "Catfruit 1" to "Catfruit 5" are Fields 1 to 5, Field 6 is already pre-filled with the XP icon.

To put a picture of Catfruit in one of the cell, just type one of these entries:

*Gold Catfruit: GoldFruit, GoldSeed
*Elder Catfruit: ElderFruit, ElderSeed
*Epic Catfruit: EpicFruit, EpicSeed
*Aku Catfruit: AkuFruit, AkuSeed
*Catfruit: PurpleFruit, RedFruit, BlueFruit, GreenFruit, YellowFruit
*Catfruit Seeds: PurpleSeed, RedSeed, BlueSeed, GreenSeed, YellowSeed
*Behemoth Stones: PurpleStone, RedStone, BlueStone, GreenStone, YellowStone, EpicStone
*Behemoth Gems: PurpleGem, RedGem, BlueGem, GreenGem, YellowGem

If you forget to fill one of these fields, then a question mark icon will appear instead.

===Second Row===
The second row displays, in the same order, the number of each of these ingredients you need.

If you forget to fill one of these fields, a question mark will appear instead.

==Example==
<tabber>
Parameters (True Form)=
<pre>
{{Catfruit Evolution
|Evolved Name =
|Evolved Image =
|True Name =
|True Image =
|True Description =
|Catfruit1 =
|Catfruit2 =
|Catfruit3 =
|Catfruit4 =
|Catfruit5 =
|Quantity Catfruit1 =
|Quantity Catfruit2 =
|Quantity Catfruit3 =
|Quantity Catfruit4 =
|Quantity Catfruit5 =
|Quantity XP =
}}
</pre>

|-|Example Usage (True Form)=
<pre>
{{Catfruit Evolution
|Evolved Name = Erphuan
|Evolved Image = Uni361 c00.png
|True Name = Aervanta
|True Image = Uni361 s00.png
|True Description = True Form evolution improves<br>attack power and defense!
|Catfruit1 = PurpleFruit
|Catfruit2 = RedFruit
|Catfruit3 = BlueFruit
|Catfruit4 = YellowFruit
|Catfruit5 = EpicFruit
|Quantity Catfruit1 = x3
|Quantity Catfruit2 = x4
|Quantity Catfruit3 = x7
|Quantity Catfruit4 = x4
|Quantity Catfruit5 = x3
|Quantity XP = 1000000
}}
</pre>

